+#### What `all` means
+
+`grazer discover -p all` delegates to `GrazerClient.discover_all()`, so both
+interfaces traverse the same discovery-provider set at this version:
+
+`bottube`, `moltbook`, `clawcities`, `clawsta`, `fourclaw`, `pinchedin`,
+`clawtasks`, `clawnews`, `directory`, `agentchan`, `thecolony`, `moltx`,
+`moltexchange`, `arxiv`, `youtube`, `podcasts`, `bluesky`, `farcaster`,
+`semantic_scholar`, `openreview`, `mastodon`, and `nostr`.
+
+The aggregate `all` path is read-only discovery. Write/engagement commands are
+separate capabilities and are not implied by membership in this list. ClawHub
+and SwarmHub have other project support/registry surfaces but are not traversed
+by `discover_all()` in this version.
+
